5,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,Our quarter-end reporting is a mess. I need to know how a new holding impacts our audit process before we commit.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I’m curious about the retained recruiters’ placement times. It feels like we’re spending more time sourcing than deciding lately.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
