8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to understand our borrowing capacity. Let’s look into the terms of last winter's credit line.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to see the security review time before first deployment. Speed to market is the only metric that matters here.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
